    "why": "Charlotte Russe sells its own labels (Stitches and Urban Ladies, plus licensed lines), so kind brand and C is a product type. Dresses are the product-type page Ahrefs ranks highest on charlotterusse.com (collections/dresses, top keyword 'charlotte russe dresses', ahead of collections/jeans; the Playboy and boots pages are a licensed line and footwear), and beautymag, the most recently updated list, says it has 'a particular emphasis on dresses and going-out looks'. Prices compare each store's regular-price dresses. Stores whose dress grids don't render to a plain fetch (Boohoo, PrettyLittleThing, Missguided, American Eagle, JustFab) or that sell in store only (rue21) render without a price via sells_categories."
